Package: dwsim-mcp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Daniel Wagner Oliveira de Medeiros <dwsim@dwsim.org>
Homepage: https://dwsim.org
Depends: libc6, libfontconfig1
Description: DWSIM process simulator - headless MCP server
 A headless build of DWSIM that exposes the flowsheet, streams, unit
 operations, thermodynamics and solver as Model Context Protocol tools over
 HTTP, so an assistant on the network can build and solve simulations.
 .
 Installs a systemd service (dwsim-mcp) that listens on a TCP port. Edit
 /etc/dwsim-mcp/dwsim-mcp.conf to set the bind address, port and token, then
 run: systemctl restart dwsim-mcp
 .
 The .NET runtime is inside the package, so nothing else has to be installed.
